<!-- Crystal crew names (docs/NAMES.md): crystals, minerals and their formations. The Crystal are the ancient ancestors
     of the Rock: the two lists are kin but share no names.

     sex: B (both), M or F, chosen by how a name sounds. A female crew member given a B name gets it with one of the
     endings in <female>, picked at random: ex="..." leaves out an ending that reads wrong on that name. A name already
     ending in one of them is its own female form; a final E drops before an ending that starts with a vowel.
     rarity: where the name comes from (docs/NAMES.md): real crystals by how well known, then names from folk speech and
     myth, from one story, and made up here. A name comes up in proportion to its level's weight. No rarity is the first.

     To change them, copy this file into names in the lore folder beside the program and edit the copy. -->
